  "id": "molar",
  "term": "molar",
  "definition": "A molar is a permanent tooth whose shape develops over time and can be altered by environmental disruptions during growth. In this packet, first molars are discussed as teeth in which linear enamel hypoplasia can mark developmental stress and be linked with small changes in crown form and cusp pattern.",
